{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>וירדנה</b> – Return to \"fire,\" for a masculine form is found, as in: \"it shall consume it, a fire not blown\" [Job 20:26]. Its sense is like: \"he shall not rule over him with harshness\" [Leviticus 25:43, לא ירדנו]."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:26.118437573Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}